OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with some outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain at first, this clearing through
OL,7,Fthe morning. Then bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells and a few showers, becoming dry
OL,9,Fby the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the
OL,12,Fevening with good clear spells and
OL,13,Fwinds falling light. Staying dry with
OL,14,Fclear spells and light winds overnight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FDry and bright morning but
OL,17,Fsunshine turning hazy as high cloud
OL,18,Fspills east through the day. Southerly
OL,19,Fwinds strengthen through the day with
OL,20,Frain in the afternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
