OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and some showers on Friday and
OL,7,FSaturday, becoming frequent for a time
OL,8,Fon Friday night. Occasionally heavy
OL,9,Frain spreads east on Sunday. Windy at
OL,10,Ftimes Friday and Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
